WEBVTT

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:03.036
Grid Bot Builder. Grid Bot Blueprint.

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:05.267
Lesson two. What you are going to need.

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:13.580
Education only. Not financial advice. This

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:17.909
is general information and doesn't

00:00:17.909 --> 00:00:19.909
consider your objectives, financial

00:00:19.909 --> 00:00:22.187
situation or needs. Crypto is high risk.

00:00:22.187 --> 00:00:24.243
You could lose all the money you put

00:00:24.243 --> 00:00:29.956
in. A packing list is written before the

00:00:29.956 --> 00:00:32.345
trip, not during the scramble at the door.

00:00:32.345 --> 00:00:34.400
The list on the left is the analogy.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.511
The chart is the trip we already took

00:00:36.511 --> 00:00:38.900
in public prices. You need the page before

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.789
you need a screen. By the end you

00:00:42.789 --> 00:00:44.901
will be able to do three things. Fill

00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:47.067
seven lines from the summer window, on

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:50.160
paper. Keep every secret off that page.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:53.444
Mark the page Example so it cannot be

00:00:53.444 --> 00:00:58.349
read as an order. The seven lines are:

00:00:58.349 --> 00:01:04.445
notebook, the three words range levels and

00:01:04.445 --> 00:01:07.860
stop, the pair name, paper or demo, no

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:09.972
secrets, a written stop, and the word

00:01:09.972 --> 00:01:12.249
Example on every figure. For this course

00:01:12.249 --> 00:01:14.249
the pair name is bitcoin versus the

00:01:14.249 --> 00:01:16.527
dollar, public daily closes. You are not

00:01:16.527 --> 00:01:18.583
choosing a venue. You are naming the

00:01:18.583 --> 00:01:23.031
series on the chart. Carry the three words

00:01:23.031 --> 00:01:36.996
forward. Range: 24930 to 30331. Levels:

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:41.269
six gaps of about 900. Stop: the close

00:01:41.269 --> 00:01:43.491
leaves 30331 and does not return, as it

00:01:43.491 --> 00:01:45.435
did on 23 October 2023. If you can

00:01:45.435 --> 00:01:47.602
only say one of them, the packing list

00:01:47.602 --> 00:01:51.346
is short a rail. You never type a

00:01:51.346 --> 00:01:56.804
seed phrase, a private key, or an A

00:01:56.804 --> 00:01:58.860
P I secret onto this page. The chart

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:00.915
has no balance on it. A public close

00:02:00.915 --> 00:02:02.915
is not your account. If a form asks

00:02:02.915 --> 00:02:04.915
for a secret, that form is not this

00:02:04.915 --> 00:02:10.857
lesson. The public path draws across this

00:02:10.857 --> 00:02:13.708
window. We stop on a handful of days,

00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:15.819
not on every print. Every close is an

00:02:15.819 --> 00:02:17.708
example. It is not a fill, and it

00:02:17.708 --> 00:02:24.346
is not a forecast. On 19 July 2023,

00:02:24.346 --> 00:02:33.340
the public daily close was 29914. That

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:41.435
day's low was 29794 and the high was

00:02:41.435 --> 00:02:43.601
30184. The close is inside the band of

00:02:43.601 --> 00:02:49.794
24930 to 30331. On 8 August 2023, the

00:02:49.794 --> 00:02:59.557
public daily close was 29765. That day's

00:02:59.557 --> 00:03:07.420
low was 29114 and the high was 30177.

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.531
The close is inside the band of 24930

00:03:09.531 --> 00:03:17.398
to 30331. On 24 August 2023, the public

00:03:17.398 --> 00:03:30.510
daily close was 26162. That day's low was

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:34.584
25915 and the high was 26555. The close

00:03:34.584 --> 00:03:37.064
is inside the band of 24930 to 30331.

00:03:37.064 --> 00:03:46.007
On 13 September 2023, the public daily

00:03:46.007 --> 00:03:57.486
close was 26228. That day's low was 25781

00:03:57.486 --> 00:04:01.532
and the high was 26376. The close is

00:04:01.532 --> 00:04:04.920
inside the band of 24930 to 30331. On

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:14.484
29 September 2023, the public daily close

00:04:14.484 --> 00:04:26.195
was 26912. That day's low was 26722 and

00:04:26.195 --> 00:04:28.417
the high was 27226. The close is inside

00:04:28.417 --> 00:04:32.699
the band of 24930 to 30331. On 16

00:04:32.699 --> 00:04:40.584
October 2023, the public daily close was

00:04:40.584 --> 00:04:52.439
28519. That day's low was 27130 and the

00:04:52.439 --> 00:04:54.661
high was 29448. The close is inside the

00:04:54.661 --> 00:04:58.636
band of 24930 to 30331. Worked check. Read

00:04:58.636 --> 00:05:05.362
the seven ideas against the page. Pair,

00:05:05.362 --> 00:05:07.529
band, gaps, stop, Example. If the stop

00:05:07.529 --> 00:05:09.640
line is only a tick with no sentence,

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:13.243
the page fails the check. Recap. The page

00:05:13.243 --> 00:05:16.977
comes before the screen. The figures are

00:05:16.977 --> 00:05:19.255
the summer low, the summer high, and six

00:05:19.255 --> 00:05:23.185
gaps. Secrets stay off the page. Example

00:05:23.185 --> 00:05:26.789
stays on it. A notebook in front of

00:05:26.789 --> 00:05:29.123
a closed laptop: plan on paper before you

00:05:29.123 --> 00:05:33.099
look at a screen. A notebook, a pencil

00:05:33.099 --> 00:05:35.433
and a laptop with a practice account: the

00:05:35.433 --> 00:05:37.809
things you need for this course. A

00:05:37.809 --> 00:05:40.777
clipboard with seven rows to tick, the

00:05:40.777 --> 00:05:43.387
setup checklist for the course. Three

00:05:43.387 --> 00:05:46.991
tiles explaining range, levels and stop in

00:05:46.991 --> 00:05:51.058
plain words. Two tokens joined by a slash:

00:05:51.058 --> 00:05:52.836
a pair is the thing you buy and

00:05:52.836 --> 00:05:56.492
what you pay with it. A laptop showing

00:05:56.492 --> 00:05:58.659
a practice account with pretend money,

00:05:58.659 --> 00:06:01.830
while a real wallet stays locked away. A

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:05.100
padlock with secret words, keys and

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:07.489
passwords around it: never type these into

00:06:07.489 --> 00:06:10.551
a chat or a form. A lone tick

00:06:10.551 --> 00:06:12.773
crossed out next to a written line with

00:06:12.773 --> 00:06:14.662
a tick: write your stop rule as a

00:06:14.662 --> 00:06:18.456
full sentence. A notebook where every

00:06:18.456 --> 00:06:20.456
number is stamped Example so nobody

00:06:20.456 --> 00:06:25.116
mistakes it for advice. A checklist with a

00:06:25.116 --> 00:06:27.394
target and a borrowing dial crossed out:

00:06:27.394 --> 00:06:29.727
profit targets and borrowed money are not

00:06:29.727 --> 00:06:33.140
part of this course. Arrows from a

00:06:33.140 --> 00:06:35.307
notebook page to a form: the form only

00:06:35.307 --> 00:06:39.399
copies what you already wrote. A path of

00:06:39.399 --> 00:06:41.565
eleven stones with a pin on the second

00:06:41.565 --> 00:06:44.313
one: you are early in the course. A

00:06:44.313 --> 00:06:47.256
form with the pair box left empty on

00:06:47.256 --> 00:06:51.275
purpose, to fill in later. Two routes to

00:06:51.275 --> 00:06:53.553
a laptop: going through the checklist is

00:06:53.553 --> 00:06:56.696
right, skipping it is a mistake. A

00:06:56.696 --> 00:06:59.491
notebook with seven boxes and a pencil

00:06:59.491 --> 00:07:01.880
ticking the first one, for you to complete

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:05.869
the checklist. A notebook with three

00:07:05.869 --> 00:07:08.147
sketches for you to label: range, levels

00:07:08.147 --> 00:07:12.135
and stop. A notebook sketch of two circles

00:07:12.135 --> 00:07:14.135
joined by a slash, for you to write

00:07:14.135 --> 00:07:18.014
a practice pair. A clipboard with all

00:07:18.014 --> 00:07:20.291
seven rows ticked and a calendar: finish

00:07:20.291 --> 00:07:23.880
the checklist today. Your notebook with an

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:25.991
arrow to the next lesson about what a

00:07:25.991 --> 00:07:31.241
grid bot is. Next lesson: What is a

00:07:31.241 --> 00:07:33.463
grid bot. Bring the page with the band,

00:07:33.463 --> 00:07:35.630
the gaps, and the stop sentence. Leave

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:37.908
every figure marked Example. No order is

00:07:37.908 --> 00:07:39.130
sent between lessons.

